      "claim": "A successful Remote Desktop logon for kim.ortega to WS-RIYER-01 came from 198.51.100.77; Sysmon also recorded an inbound connection from that address to the workstation's RDP port shortly beforehand. This conflicts with the provided context that remote administration is only performed from WS-KORTEGA-01 inside the office.",
